SUBENT        C3138003   20260807   20261014   20261014       C259
BIB                  4         12
REACTION   (8-O-14(D,INL)8-O-14,PAR,DA)
ANALYSIS   Experimental angular distributions were obtained for
           various energy bins of the cross-section data ranging
           from 4 to 26 MeV. Energy intervals of 2 MeV were
           selected to reduce statistical fluctuations. Angular
           distribution fits for the energy bins centered at 5,
           11 and 17 MeV are given in the article.
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) The error bars in the data include
           statistical and systematic uncertainties.
